  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8832cff277924f7c30f1a070",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在多云天气和躁动的空气中进行，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b5d5e6a7096f347e024818b464b40e1e4fd2114745a2d069e103a5856b570d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2994"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74a17a695ca2b02cb9b5299f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "上天赋予的试炼之雨，\n暗流涌动的%course%ground%distance\n终于要开始了",
      "source_fingerprint": "30f411de36ac4154eb226adc112e3b2c2375da66398c5392eef73b51a25f3965",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2995"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ca50fd058936fe6edf950e3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "仍然寒冷的%course，等待着挑战者\n大雪中的%ground%distance\n究竟哪位赛马娘能够抵达胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3805c39d3dfd4113b8bf1d339665e502291bd50fbbde42a4abc3b85d8f6f8ac9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2996"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:285ec6c7fdad2a99ab0ef3b5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太阳已经完全落山，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "9952b46d1b5e3d290f22830b4771c8031326365a4456d83e1f07b090ab6e78ec",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2997"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d44a0b509d9d5aad81ba12",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在夜空中繁星的注视下，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa1dab3f544d08b86c50369a18fdacbebf783d61a8281f1819ece33401107c62",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2998"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4615334274a8d96f6d8f915a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在星空之下举行，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "65f4c645a2481bcd3980bec0a6e341fb2d6f2830ee5f777ce6aa04e22d972d75",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2999"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426e35c77a4c3162f9beb5f7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在令脚底泥泞的大雨中，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "73647efca18d1a81d6cdb62885806ad4813d0a79a8e503d05638f32293ba81c4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a735000d70cead22ef72fc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "独一无二，赌上一面坚盾的热血战斗！\n最长距离GⅠ天皇赏（春）！",
      "source_fingerprint": "799389c7d49dad9d4bc5bd9483fd2c5e2b42f1510e897f16a6768e0494a8a992",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c1727ec1dca734f2a2ab81",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "秋之京都女王降临！\n%h_rank_l1！　完美称霸秋华赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f9d92fe17e91e1b8d64403ce5e84d8069e93020ad864631abdf05bfa251c579",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:481eb397620f2e938d20e05f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "笼罩夜空的乌云营造了紧张氛围\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9fa9d4c6f3bc3f34d12c77eede9a1bf25889c2c9b0992ca09775520842cca11",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b589555971e96e1c653a010",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "雨点在光照下闪闪发光，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ae640e265f2ba5c1fe3f47b4ba3cfd6ce91c0ad5fbb5d1574fc081bf2040964",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d721911a934802537d384068",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "夜雨使人有一种动荡不安的预感，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "45acf7271f2e9bfb1906f8bb2eaa32aa2e9d4bd98e25d1a9ed94655896d10c38",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084ebc03aaf7257d56af5119",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\n%race_wo！\n距离顶点还差一步！　决胜的时刻到了",
      "source_fingerprint": "211e6f97e9357fbc892be74a5bb6bbe2648706c2b5806cce93d86dca59695ade",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa53375e7a04090764147c8e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\n%race_wo！\n此时此刻，优骏的顶点诞生了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd9c204362f1fb5da1b76abac2ccc098bd4ea62dbc8b67a2b78779d7df2c52aa",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f34b97104df55ac9ba08ce55",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "团队比赛开始了！\n重要的第一战，谁将连结胜利的纽带！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4380134d2a0cf92c3506a08dfe00e4f002393030ea4100131fff44f57a630a29",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b6402b3ab0e7e862af0cfd4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "脱离降级圈的重要一步，\n能迈出这步的是哪位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6cbdd51d46ba93651a4db224ed1f9b86fa9a7d742f5fa4a8783c5df57d4f08",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1db2a8bf6cae9dde4203866",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "根据第一场比赛的结果踏入第二场比赛，\n各赛马娘背负着队伍的希望进行挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db978b526e1aec3b1d8f0533f7c6880acb913f88e29b948eed72c2f94f64a9e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf147f243a9548a82ec9697",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜利纽带能继续连结下去吗！\n大家对第二场比赛的期待愈发高涨！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2888bcd88ac9517417d92c9f09827bd7f4673653e03bc7caeda7b26bad597a2c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d812f12fd6d8a3c32e0ea76a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第二场比赛要开始了\n心中怀着悔恨，\n能够一雪第一场比赛的耻辱吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e49e44eff15848ba09c4f4afd858312051ee8780d66a3e00e839d405024e18",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57c764df6b94d8a59a91f9e7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n在菊之舞台精彩地斩获了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8565db60e10e8df045a35c0202d68bb2d718decefa030314584260778dbee213",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8491a682ce0119b03b78e7f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "作为转折点的第三场比赛\n不管怎样都要拿到好结果\n迎接下半段比赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e79bd573834b7ee3fde7982732c3e4260ddfd8e9fba159e5970cbf89d95ea44",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8762ba06b376448b91c82f78",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "目前仍有一支队伍未尝一败\n观众们的期待愈发高涨！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71f21daa539ad9cf243290c109639f75096b5b22aec77780d7185dc0b06c3c9f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32eb1487afd22d99fc891305",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "一支队伍已经没有退路了\n能在这里卷土重来吗，拭目以待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d6b563a1b59c7a233cd1a25a94fac1ac9d9d43c88cafe2ecf9ac3124943aa8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f26888eda2e6ace066580e80",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "对决已接近尾声，第四场比赛！\n面向最后的舞台，能够取得好结果吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe73aba1c818248743e8bed540cc5785f97917d6a1b3ca991f92d7b313c55ef",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7fa2dff07fe98e8462086b6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "观众的热情涌了上来！\n不必多说，他们期待的是\n那支队伍的那位赛马娘吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f16a55b8aa0ee858981e81e27a17d930f5dcf122e9b9d4397d6fce2ff4bc1952",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:495e15384317ce644d8f070e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "对于想要挽回局面的队伍来说，这是最后机会了\n最为重要的第四场比赛，终于要开始了",
      "source_fingerprint": "39a306e7439dc2ca64c1fff6b982daeabc536bda149bdddd46e37d8c65466441",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862dce4b0117e0eeb64fd077",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "终于来到最后的大舞台，第五场比赛！\n胸怀着全队坚持至此的希望，\n她们能抓住荣光吗，决胜时刻到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a1ee6009f0932806ad45660d6460bd84d903c9994e979efdb17e489da7ffdf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:700c290b4b8fd46a5d7f72a0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "竟然有至今为止全胜的队伍！\n能够成就伟业吗！\n最终决战，要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb64a99578799e2a8045a6904303024f74147e36b965ea4a2d395d054b636012",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56498b35e47460bc7766012c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "被迫陷入苦战的队伍，\n绝对要这场比赛取得胜利！\n她们能够善始善终吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb6ed04decf4df6c84cf3cc687c29276cf9155cc6f9f97f8f49270adbaf7f940",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8c9caa3c050fa356ccdf518",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "短距离战的猛者们聚集于这场比赛，\n比赛局势应该会从序盘开始就令人目不转睛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3766148917c5ec99e0b4fb27e8a06e0c005c6093efd839e85edb70a11871abb6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d2cd9df0fbfcf772207e2f7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太棒了，%h_rank_l1！\n力压群雄\n称霸了天皇赏（秋）！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22973d4aed25402459d361ea8de284322f90950a693bfdafd091f621027ef42b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee9707d42bd3c251248dcdd2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "对英里战有自信的赛马娘们聚集在这场比赛，\n她们会拿出怎样的结果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a692572e63a7fb4b26ebbe1acc38c113c110978a7cb08170b4068383df7722",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b99dabdb6865e500fd65f3b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "对中距离战有自信的赛马娘们聚集在这场比赛，\n比赛局势毫无疑问会有精彩的发展！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1d790dab66614025aacbe02fe0c1906f8d6f5bdd4a85f5dc2dff788c35798f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126ee0317a9bac5ac9159d40",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "对长距离战有自信的赛马娘们聚集在这场比赛，\n她们将谱写出怎样的故事呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97382b7286a4dcaa1f08197eaded889e547ffad40a58dbcf2802fa0b3db9fbfc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e711fa301a65188ec1087c1c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "沙土巧者在这场比赛中汇聚一堂，\n能够在最前方冲线的会是哪位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e5183df430510aece433236bc79d8e090ccbefc9fddc49479cbd5fc7582495",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:999afdb1c3ee88fd2ddff9b3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n用最好的开始为团队献上第一场胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2581a4e59f857d83b23d0bb93a2f2146d5c521ad3db6700403cb439d81672338",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cb4ad8f2b92dbd05bbd7ce7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_ta1制霸了第二场比赛！\n她精彩的奔跑为团队带来了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01b170825b36b808cce53c3b6a6d7f4b9c769f220587a0cfc71245a92f04631",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db488dd59a7e1f62e886b8fa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第一名是%h_rank_l1！\n取得第三场比赛的胜利，\n毫无疑问的转折点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74a722685bc3c62642a616a7e5837d1ef629473e68f9a2a823711529d20fd3c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ccd1543e0b3d8e806619f75",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n为最终战增添了士气，一次重大的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3127884452145e5b6c6ac3cc20e41a4b453c6ebac9d5af9c0188ef54f01a954",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd2a2f955174849e158448fb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "精彩斩获第四场比赛胜利的是%h_rank_ta1！\n团队也取得了出色的成绩，\n她们的势头已经无人可挡了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf85bc76227be255fe9b0b7fd2a3f9eea339398532ab2299cec32ce5dcce69b2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a6855c68dd8a2d735f7780",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "首位冲线的是%h_rank_ta1！\n她以振奋团队的出色表现，\n取得了第四场比赛的胜利！",
